message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "SEE4994: Comparative Analysis of Urban Air Pollution in Hong Kong and Mexico City"
authors:
  - family-names: Rico Esparza
    given-names: Erick
    orcid: "0000-0000-0000-0000"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2025-02-01"
doi: ""
url: "https://github.com/erick-rico/see4994_pollution_comparison"
abstract: >
  This repository contains the analysis, code, figures, and final report for a synoptic-scale
  comparative study of extreme air-pollution days in Mexico City and Hong Kong, conducted
  under the SEE4994 Guided Study at City University of Hong Kong (Fall 2025). It includes 
  long-term pollutant datasets (2012–2024), composite anomaly workflows using NARR, weekly 
  progress, and final deliverables.